    "Each medicine gets the next color in the order it first appears on your server, so every phone shows the same colors. A color you change here changes on this phone only.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Each medicine gets the next color in the order it first appears on your server, so every phone shows the same colors. A color you change here changes on this phone only."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Jedes Medikament erhält die nächste Farbe in der Reihenfolge, in der es auf deinem Server erstmals vorkommt. So zeigen alle Geräte dieselben Farben. Änderungen hier gelten nur für dieses Gerät."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cada remédio recebe a próxima cor na ordem em que aparece pela primeira vez no seu servidor, então todos os celulares mostram as mesmas cores. Uma cor alterada aqui muda só neste celular."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each phone schedules its own medication reminders from synced doses, so pull to refresh before giving a dose in case someone else just logged one.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Each phone schedules its own medication reminders from synced doses, so pull to refresh before giving a dose in case someone else just logged one."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Jedes Gerät plant seine eigenen Medikamentenerinnerungen anhand der synchronisierten Gaben. Aktualisiere vor einer Gabe durch Herunterziehen, falls jemand anderes gerade eine Gabe erfasst hat."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cada celular agenda os próprios lembretes de remédio a partir das doses sincronizadas. Puxe para atualizar antes de dar uma dose, caso alguém tenha acabado de registrar uma."
          }
        }
      }
    },
