    "I do read everything and try to reply to everyone.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I do read everything and try to reply to everyone."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich lese alle Nachrichten und versuche, allen zu antworten."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eu leio tudo e tento responder a todo mundo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I'll remove your feedback account within 7 days. Your posts and comments stay on the board under \"Deleted user\", your votes are removed, and your support chats are kept without your email. Your Baby Buddy data isn't affected.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I'll remove your feedback account within 7 days. Your posts and comments stay on the board under \"Deleted user\", your votes are removed, and your support chats are kept without your email. Your Baby Buddy data isn't affected."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich lösche dein Feedback-Konto innerhalb von 7 Tagen. Deine Beiträge und Kommentare bleiben unter „Deleted user“ (Gelöschter Nutzer) sichtbar. Deine Stimmen werden entfernt und deine Support-Chats ohne deine E-Mail-Adresse aufbewahrt. Deine Baby-Buddy-Daten sind davon nicht betroffen."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vou remover sua conta de feedback em até 7 dias. Seus posts e comentários continuam no quadro como \"Deleted user\" (usuário apagado), seus votos são removidos e suas conversas de suporte ficam guardadas sem o seu e-mail. Seus dados do Baby Buddy não são afetados."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If it checks a header": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If it checks a header"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wenn ein Header geprüft wird"
