        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Se ele verifica um cabeçalho"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If the app helps, you can support its development.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If the app helps, you can support its development."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wenn die App dir hilft, kannst du ihre Entwicklung unterstützen."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Se o app ajuda, você pode apoiar o desenvolvimento."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If this %@ was already saved when the timer was stopped, you'll end up with two copies. Check the server first if you're unsure.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If this %@ was already saved when the timer was stopped, you'll end up with two copies. Check the server first if you're unsure."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Falls dieser Eintrag (%@) beim Stoppen des Timers bereits gespeichert wurde, entstehen zwei Kopien. Prüfe bei Unsicherheit zuerst den Server."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Se este registro (%@) já tinha sido salvo quando o cronômetro parou, você vai ficar com duas cópias. Na dúvida, confira o servidor antes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In Cloudflare Zero Trust, create a **service token**. Copy the Client ID and Client Secret. The secret is shown only once.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In Cloudflare Zero Trust, create a **service token**. Copy the Client ID and Client Secret. The secret is shown only once."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Erstelle in Cloudflare Zero Trust einen **Service-Token**. Kopiere Client-ID und Client-Secret. Das Secret wird nur einmal angezeigt."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No Cloudflare Zero Trust, crie um **service token**. Copie o Client ID e o Client Secret. O secret só aparece uma vez."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In the Access application for **%@**, add a policy with the **Service Auth** action for that token.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In the Access application for **%@**, add a policy with the **Service Auth** action for that token."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Füge in der Access-Anwendung für **%@** eine Richtlinie mit der Aktion **Service Auth** für diesen Token hinzu."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Na aplicação do Access para **%@**, adicione uma política com a ação **Service Auth** para esse token."
          }
        }
      }
    },
